<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: guild.name + ' · Dashboard — Clawdia' }) %>
    <%# Chart.js is deliberately not here (#685). It is vendored under /vendor/
        and injected by loadChartJs() the first time a chart is about to be
        drawn — only the Analytics panel and the Economy panel's Health tab draw
        one, and most sessions open neither. %>
    <%# `defer` rather than a bare tag (#945). This sat in <head> as a synchronous
        script, which stops the parser for a whole round trip before anything is
        painted — and for nothing, because no other script in <head> reads
        escHtml. Its only consumers are the page scripts at the end of <body>
        and the panel renderers they call, none of which run until after parse.

        Every one of those carries `defer` too, and that is load-bearing rather
        than tidiness: deferred scripts run in document order *after* every
        parser-executed one, so deferring this alone would move it behind the
        scripts that call escHtml at load. Deferring all of them keeps the order
        they have always run in — escHtml, then the payload builder, then the
        page's own scripts — while none of them blocks the parse. The inline
        bootstrap block stays inline and undeferred, so window.CLAWDIA_BOOTSTRAP
        is still set before any of them looks at it. %>
    <script defer src="<%= asset('/esc-html.js') %>"></script>
</head>
<body style="background:var(--ink-950);margin:0;">
<%# First tab stop on the page. The sidebar is 25 items long and is rebuilt on
    every panel visit, so without this a keyboard user walks all of it to reach
    the settings they just opened. Visible only while focused. %>
<a class="skip-link" href="#dash-main-content">Skip to main content</a>
<div class="dash">

    <!-- ── SIDEBAR ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <aside class="dash-side">

        <%# Brand, and — narrow only — the control that folds the rest of the
            sidebar away. Below 768px the whole column stacks *above* the
            content, so every visit to a panel used to open on a scroll past 25
            nav items, a search box and the user footer to reach the settings
            being edited (#674).

            The button ships `hidden` and guild-settings.js unhides it once it
            has confirmed the viewport is narrow. That way the collapse only
            ever exists where something can open it again: with no script, or
            in a browser without matchMedia, the nav stays exactly as it is
            today rather than folding shut with no way back. %>
        <div class="dash-side-head">
            <a href="/" class="cw-brand-link">
                <%- include('partials/brand-mark', { size: 24, fill: '#ece4d2', accent: '#e89163' }) %>
                <span class="cw-wordmark cw-side-wordmark">Clawdia</span>
            </a>
            <button type="button" class="dash-nav-toggle" id="dash-nav-toggle" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="dash-side-nav dash-side-footer" hidden>
                <svg class="dash-nav-toggle-icon dash-nav-toggle-open" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/></svg>
                <svg class="dash-nav-toggle-icon dash-nav-toggle-close" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/></svg>
                <span>Menu</span>
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Server switcher -->
        <a href="/dashboard" class="dash-server-switch">
            <%# ?size=64 for a 36px tile, and no lazy: the server switcher is the
                first thing in the sidebar. The fallback tile is .dash-server-avatar
                below, which carries its own size and gradient, so the handler in
                partials/head.ejs swaps the element rather than the src (#946). %>
            <% if (guild.icon) { %>
                <img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/icons/<%= guild.id %>/<%= guild.icon %>.png?size=64" alt=""
                     width="36" height="36" decoding="async"
                     style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;"
                     data-fallback-class="dash-server-avatar"
                     data-fallback-text="<%= guild.name.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %>">
            <% } else { %>
                <div class="dash-server-avatar"><%= guild.name.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %></div>
            <% } %>
            <div class="dash-server-name">
                <b title="<%= guild.name %>"><%= guild.name %></b>
                <span>Switch server</span>
            </div>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 9l4-4 4 4M8 15l4 4 4-4"/></svg>
        </a>

        <%# A landmark, so a screen reader can jump to the section list — and
            can skip past it — instead of walking the sidebar from the top.
            The search filters this list, so it lives inside the landmark. %>
        <nav class="dash-side-nav" id="dash-side-nav" aria-label="Dashboard sections">

        <!-- Sidebar search -->
        <div class="dash-nav-search-wrap">
            <svg class="dash-nav-search-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
            <input type="search" id="sidebar-search" class="dash-nav-search" placeholder="Search sections… (/ or Ctrl+K)" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Filter dashboard sections">
        </div>
        <div id="sidebar-no-results" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--ink-400);padding:6px 8px;">No sections match</div>

        <!-- Configure -->
        <div class="dash-nav-label" id="nav-group-configure">// Configure</div>
        <ul class="dash-nav" aria-labelledby="nav-group-configure">
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item active" data-tab="overview" data-keywords="stats kpis dashboard home" aria-current="page"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9"/><line x1="9" y1="21" x2="9" y2="9"/></svg><span>Overview</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="welcome" data-keywords="join greet card dm autorole message"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 16c2 0 2-3 4-3s2 3 4 3 2-3 4-3 2 3 4 3"/><path d="M3 11c2 0 2-3 4-3s2 3 4 3 2-3 4-3 2 3 4 3"/></svg><span>Welcome</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="farewell" data-keywords="leave goodbye departure"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3"/><path d="M14 12H21"/><path d="M18 9l3 3-3 3"/></svg><span>Farewell</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="leveling" data-keywords="xp level rank points progression"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-8"/><path d="M15 7h6v6"/></svg><span>Leveling</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="economy" data-keywords="coins currency shop store jobs work daily"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><path d="M10 9h3a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-3v-4zM10 13v3"/></svg><span>Economy</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="birthdays" data-keywords="birthday celebration age"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 21h16v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2z"/><path d="M4 16c1.6 0 1.6 1.5 3.2 1.5S8.8 16 10.4 16s1.6 1.5 3.2 1.5S15.2 16 16.8 16s1.6 1.5 3.2 1.5"/><path d="M12 4v4"/></svg><span>Birthdays</span></button></li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Moderation -->
        <div class="dash-nav-label" id="nav-group-moderation">// Moderation</div>
        <ul class="dash-nav" aria-labelledby="nav-group-moderation">
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="moderation" data-keywords="ban kick mute warn automod spam filter profanity caps"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8.5-8 9-4.5-.5-8-4-8-9V6l8-3z"/></svg><span>Moderation</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="raiddetection" data-keywords="raid bot attack lockdown"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4l9 16H3z"/><line x1="12" y1="10" x2="12" y2="14"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="17"/></svg><span>Raid Detection</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="antinuke" data-keywords="nuke protect security whitelist threshold"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4"/></svg><span>Anti-Nuke</span></button></li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Progression -->
        <div class="dash-nav-label" id="nav-group-progression">// Progression</div>
        <ul class="dash-nav" aria-labelledby="nav-group-progression">
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="achievements" data-keywords="badge milestone unlock reward"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="5"/><path d="M8.5 13L7 21l5-3 5 3-1.5-8"/></svg><span>Achievements</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="quests" data-keywords="task challenge daily weekly mission"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 21V4"/><path d="M5 4h11l-2 4 2 4H5"/></svg><span>Quests</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="exploration" data-keywords="explore expedition region map secret treasure relic wilds"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M15.5 8.5l-2 5-5 2 2-5z"/></svg><span>Exploration</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="season" data-keywords="seasonal pass battle tier"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 4h8v4a4 4 0 0 1-8 0V4z"/><path d="M5 6H3v1a3 3 0 0 0 3 3M19 6h2v1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3"/><path d="M9 14h6l1 6H8z"/></svg><span>Season Pass</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="progressiontracks" data-keywords="track creator helper raider bonus xp multiplier"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="2"/><path d="M8 19h5a4 4 0 0 0 0-8h-2a4 4 0 0 1 0-8h5"/></svg><span>Progression Tracks</span></button></li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Community -->
        <div class="dash-nav-label" id="nav-group-community">// Community</div>
        <ul class="dash-nav" aria-labelledby="nav-group-community">
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="starboard" data-keywords="star highlight pin featured"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l2.5 6 6.5.5-5 4.2 1.6 6.3L12 17l-5.6 3 1.6-6.3-5-4.2 6.5-.5z"/></svg><span>Starboard</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="suggestions" data-keywords="ideas feedback vote upvote downvote approve staff anonymous"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.5 18h5"/><path d="M10 21h4"/><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0-3.5 10.9c.6.5.9 1.1 1 1.9h5c.1-.8.4-1.4 1-1.9A6 6 0 0 0 12 3z"/></svg><span>Suggestions</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="reactionroles" data-keywords="self assign emoji role react"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"/><line x1="9" y1="9.5" x2="9" y2="9.5"/><line x1="15" y1="9.5" x2="15" y2="9.5"/></svg><span>Reaction Roles</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="publicpage" data-keywords="public web share leaderboard profile page slug unfurl"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><path d="M12 3c2.5 2.5 2.5 15 0 18M12 3c-2.5 2.5-2.5 15 0 18"/></svg><span>Public Page</span></button></li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Tools -->
        <div class="dash-nav-label" id="nav-group-tools">// Tools</div>
        <ul class="dash-nav" aria-labelledby="nav-group-tools">
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="commandpolicies" data-keywords="permissions restrict cooldown command disable"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="4" y1="7" x2="20" y2="7"/><line x1="4" y1="17" x2="20" y2="17"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="2.2"/><circle cx="15" cy="17" r="2.2"/></svg><span>Command Policies</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="ai" data-keywords="chatbot gpt openai knowledge persona summary"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.4 7.3L6.1 4l3.3 1.8M16.6 7.3L17.9 4l-3.3 1.8"/><path d="M5 7.2h14a1.2 1.2 0 0 1 1.2 1.2v6.3a1.2 1.2 0 0 1-1.2 1.2h-6.3L9 20v-3.1H5a1.2 1.2 0 0 1-1.2-1.2V8.4A1.2 1.2 0 0 1 5 7.2z"/><circle cx="9.7" cy="11.6" r=".95" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="14.3" cy="11.6" r=".95" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg><span>Ask Clawdia</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="tempvoice" data-keywords="voice channel temporary dynamic create"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 5L6 9H3v6h3l5 4z"/><path d="M15.5 8.5a5 5 0 0 1 0 7"/><path d="M18.5 6a9 9 0 0 1 0 12"/></svg><span>Temp Voice</span></button></li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Feeds & Automation -->
        <div class="dash-nav-label" id="nav-group-feeds">// Feeds &amp; Automation</div>
        <ul class="dash-nav" aria-labelledby="nav-group-feeds">
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="newspaper" data-keywords="news daily digest article ai"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h13v15H5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 18.5z"/><path d="M17 9h3v9.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-3 0"/><line x1="7" y1="9" x2="14" y2="9"/><line x1="7" y1="12" x2="14" y2="12"/><line x1="7" y1="15" x2="11" y2="15"/></svg><span>Newspaper</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="bibleverses" data-keywords="bible verse scripture daily scripture"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 3H19v15H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 20.5z"/><line x1="9" y1="7" x2="14" y2="7"/></svg><span>Bible Verses</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="rss" data-keywords="feed rss atom url news blog"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5a14 14 0 0 1 14 14"/><path d="M5 12a7 7 0 0 1 7 7"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="1.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg><span>RSS Feeds</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="social" data-keywords="social youtube reddit twitter x instagram tiktok creator upload notification follow"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.7 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.4 0"/></svg><span>Social</span></button></li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Insights -->
        <div class="dash-nav-label" id="nav-group-insights">// Insights</div>
        <ul class="dash-nav" aria-labelledby="nav-group-insights">
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="analytics" data-keywords="stats graphs reports activity commands usage"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 14l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg><span>Analytics</span></button></li>
            <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-tab="eventlog" data-keywords="log audit events voice messages members server"><svg class="nav-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="17" rx="2"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="9"/><line x1="9" y1="13" x2="15" y2="13"/><line x1="9" y1="17" x2="12" y2="17"/></svg><span>Event Log</span></button></li>
        </ul>

        </nav><!-- /.dash-side-nav -->

        <!-- User footer -->
        <div class="dash-side-footer" id="dash-side-footer">
            <div class="dash-user">
                <%# The sidebar footer's own avatar; same treatment as the switcher
                    above, 34px, .dash-user-avatar as the fallback tile (#946). %>
                <% if (user.avatar) { %>
                    <img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/<%= user.id %>/<%= user.avatar %>.png?size=64" alt=""
                         width="34" height="34" decoding="async"
                         style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0;"
                         data-fallback-class="dash-user-avatar"
                         data-fallback-text="<%= user.username.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %>">
                <% } else { %>
                    <div class="dash-user-avatar"><%= user.username.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %></div>
                <% } %>
                <div>
                    <b><%= user.username %></b>
                    <span><%= guild.owner ? 'Owner' : 'Admin' %> · <%= guild.name %></span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </aside><!-- /.dash-side -->

    <!-- ── MAIN ──────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <main class="dash-main" id="dash-main-content" tabindex="-1">

        <!-- Top bar -->
        <div class="dash-topbar">
            <div style="flex:1;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-400);">
                <%= guild.name %> / <span style="color:var(--cream-100);" id="topbar-section">Overview</span>
            </div>
            <%# Names the sections holding unsaved edits. The sidebar marks them
                with a dot too, but a dot is colour and shape carrying meaning on
                its own (WCAG 1.4.1) and says nothing about a section scrolled out
                of view — so this is where the state is actually stated. `polite`,
                and rewritten only when the set of sections changes, so it is
                announced once rather than on every keystroke. %>
            <p class="unsaved-banner" id="unsaved-banner" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" hidden>
                <span class="unsaved-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                Unsaved changes in <strong id="unsaved-banner-sections"></strong>
            </p>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="all-servers-link">← All servers</a>
        </div>

        <%# Only the active panel ships with the page. The rest are stubs that
            guild-settings.js swaps for real markup, fetched from
            /dashboard/guild/:guildId/panel/:panel, the first time their tab is
            opened — roughly 200 KB of HTML a reader may never look at. %>
<% panels.forEach(function(panelName) { %><% if (panelName === activePanel) { %>
        <%- include('partials/panels/' + panelName) %>
<% } else { %>
        <div class="panel-stub" data-panel="<%= panelName %>" style="display:none;"><div class="panel-stub-message" role="status">Loading…</div></div>
<% } %><% }); %>

        </main><!-- /.dash-main -->

</div><!-- /.dash -->

    <%# A session that idled out is not an error the page can retry its way past,
        so it does not report through the toast below: a toast is transient, and
        this has to stay on screen until it is acted on. `role="alert"` so a
        screen reader hears it the moment it appears rather than whenever the
        user next tabs past it — unlike the toast, this does interrupt, because
        every control on the page has just stopped working.

        The link opens in a new tab deliberately. This tab is holding unsaved
        edits, and navigating it to Discord's OAuth flow would throw them away;
        the session cookie is set for the whole site, so signing in beside this
        tab is enough to make its next request work. guild-settings.js takes the
        banner back down as soon as one does (#878). %>
    <div class="session-expired" id="session-expired" role="alert" hidden>
        <span class="session-expired-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚠</span>
        <span class="session-expired-message">
            Your session expired. <a href="/auth/login" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sign in again in a new tab</a>, then come back here and retry — nothing you have typed has been lost.
        </span>
    </div>

    <%# Every save, delete and failure in the dashboard reports through this
        one element, so it has to be announced: without a live region a screen
        reader user gets no confirmation that anything happened at all. The
        icon and the "Error"/"Saved" prefix guild-settings.js writes are what
        carry the outcome — the border colour alone did, which WCAG 1.4.1
        rules out. `polite` rather than `assertive`: these follow an action
        the reader just took, so they do not need to cut in. %>
    <div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
        <span class="toast-icon" id="toast-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="toast-message" id="toast-message"></span>
        <button type="button" class="toast-close" id="toast-close" aria-label="Dismiss message" hidden>✕</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Generic confirm modal -->
    <div id="confirm-modal" class="modal-overlay" style="display:none;" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="confirm-modal-title">
        <div class="modal-box" style="max-width:440px;">
            <div class="modal-head"><span id="confirm-modal-title">Confirm</span><button class="modal-close" data-action="confirm-cancel" aria-label="Close the confirmation dialog">✕</button></div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <p id="confirm-modal-body" style="margin:0;line-height:1.5"></p>
                <div id="confirm-modal-type-reset" style="display:none;margin-top:.75rem;">
                    <label class="field-label" for="confirm-type-input" id="confirm-type-label">Type <strong>RESET</strong> to confirm</label>
                    <input type="text" id="confirm-type-input" placeholder="RESET" autocomplete="off">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-actions">
                <button class="btn" data-action="confirm-cancel">Cancel</button>
                <button class="btn btn-danger" id="confirm-modal-ok" data-action="confirm-ok">Confirm</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
